<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover"><meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow"><meta name="referrer" content="no-referrer"><title>You&#39;re set up — Taptime</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/static/css/app.css"></head><body class="min-h-screen bg-porcelain text-ink antialiased"><main class="mx-auto flex w-full max-w-md flex-col gap-6 px-4 py-8"><header class="flex items-baseline justify-between"><span class="font-display text-lg font-bold tracking-tight text-tappa-green">taptime</span> <span class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-ink/70">punchless</span></header><section class="docket"><p class="docket-label">Activated</p><h1 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-ink">You're set, Maria Borg</h1><p class="mt-1 text-ink/70">St Julians</p></section><section class="border-l-4 border-tappa-green bg-green-lite px-4 py-4"><p class="font-display font-bold tracking-tight">This phone is now your time clock.</p><div class="mt-1 text-sm text-ink/85">Hold it near the plaque at the door and press the one button you see. That is the whole thing — there is nothing to install and nothing to remember.</div></section> <section class="bg-paper border border-line px-4 py-4"><p class="text-sm text-ink/85">One last thing: connect to <span class="num font-bold">KF-StJulians-Staff</span> when you are at work, so Taptime can see you are on site.</p></section>  <p class="pt-2 text-center font-display text-lg tracking-tight text-ink/70">All done — you can close this page.</p></main></body></html>